      "writtenOn": "2018-01-11T20:45:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `self.create_application_credential` method just creates a dict, so this isn\u0027t changing an already-created app cred. I\u0027ll make the helper method private so that\u0027s more clear.\n\nSort of worth noting that it\u0027s currently only immutable by virtue of there not being an update method, so there\u0027s not a good way to test that here in the manager. There\u0027s a test in the controller showing that a PATCH doesn\u0027t work.",
      "parentUuid": "7f96bb07_31eeb622",
